{"seq":4,"slug":"intellectual-property","title":"知识产权","stage":"DONE","category":"law-legal","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/intellectual-property","rating":{"composite":3.62,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.31,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"知识产权-简介\">知识产权 简介</h1><p>知识产权是技术从业者最容易忽视却又最直接影响其职业利益的法律领域。你编写的每一行代码、设计的每一个算法、创建的每一个开源项目，都涉及知识产权的归属与保护问题。对于程序员、开源贡献者和技术创业者而言，理解知识产权法律体系不仅是保护自身成果的需要，更是规避法律风险的基本素养。</p>\n<p>本知识库以中国现行知识产权法律体系为主线，兼顾国际通行规则，聚焦软件开发和科技创业中的核心知识产权问题。内容设计以实用性为优先，帮助读者在开发、创业和开源协作等场景中做出合规的知识产权决策。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>知识产权概论</strong>从宏观视角介绍知识产权的基本概念和法律体系，梳理知识产权制度的历史演进，从经济学角度分析知识产权制度的存在逻辑，并介绍企业和个人层面的知识产权战略思维。这一章为后续的专题学习提供框架性认知。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>著作权法</strong>深入讲解与软件开发最密切相关的著作权制度，涵盖著作权的基本原理、软件著作权的特殊规定、合理使用与授权许可的边界，以及数字版权管理的技术与法律问题。无论你是独立开发者还是企业员工，著作权都是你最常接触的知识产权类型。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>专利法</strong>系统介绍专利制度的基本框架，重点分析软件专利的可专利性争议、专利申请的完整流程，以及面对专利侵权指控时的应对策略。对于技术创业者和从事核心技术研发的工程师，专利知识尤为重要。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>商业秘密与商标</strong>覆盖另外两个重要的知识产权类型。商业秘密保护涉及技术秘密和商业信息的法律保护机制，商标法涉及品牌标识的注册与保护，域名争议等网络标识问题也在讨论范围之内。本章最后专门探讨开源软件与知识产权的交叉问题，这是技术社区最关注的话题之一。</p>\n<p>建议读者先通过第一章建立整体认知，然后根据自身需求选择后续章节。日常编码和开源贡献者重点关注第二章和第四章，技术创业者和研发负责人则应深入学习第三章。全部章节完整阅读后，你将具备应对大多数技术场景下知识产权问题的基本能力。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ip-overview","title":"知识产权概论","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/intellectual-property/ip-overview","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ip-system","title":"知识产权体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/intellectual-property/ip-overview/ip-system"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ip-history","title":"知识产权发展简史","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/intellectual-property/ip-overview/ip-history"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ip-economics","title":"知识产权的经济学分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/intellectual-property/ip-overview/ip-economics"},{"seq":4,"slug":"ip-strategy","title":"知识产权战略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/intellectual-property/ip-overview/ip-strategy"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"copyright","title":"著作权法","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/intellectual-property/copyright","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"copyright-basics","title":"著作权基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/intellectual-property/copyright/copyright-basics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"software-copyright","title":"软件著作权","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/intellectual-property/copyright/software-copyright"},{"seq":3,"slug":"fair-use","title":"合理使用与授权","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/intellectual-property/copyright/fair-use"},{"seq":4,"slug":"digital-copyright","title":"数字版权与 DRM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/intellectual-property/copyright/digital-copyright"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"patent","title":"专利法","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/intellectual-property/patent","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"patent-basics","title":"专利法基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/intellectual-property/patent/patent-basics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"software-patent","title":"软件专利","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/intellectual-property/patent/software-patent"},{"seq":3,"slug":"patent-application","title":"专利申请流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/intellectual-property/patent/patent-application"},{"seq":4,"slug":"patent-infringement","title":"专利侵权与应对","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/intellectual-property/patent/patent-infringement"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"trade-secret","title":"商业秘密与商标","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/intellectual-property/trade-secret","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"trade-secret-protection","title":"商业秘密保护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/intellectual-property/trade-secret/trade-secret-protection"},{"seq":2,"slug":"trademark-basics","title":"商标法基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/intellectual-property/trade-secret/trademark-basics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"domain-names","title":"域名与网络标识","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/intellectual-property/trade-secret/domain-names"},{"seq":4,"slug":"open-source-ip","title":"开源与知识产权","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-